error_3_verbatim: lib.customisation.callPackageWith: Function called without required argument "svgo" at .../overlay/mobile-nixos/gui-assets/default.nix:6
fix_3       : new os/overlays/svgo.nix nixpkgs overlay wired via `nixpkgs.overlays` in os/mobile.nix — the pinned nixos-25.05 has `nodePackages.svgo` but no top-level `pkgs.svgo`, while mobile-nixos gui-assets (rev 2c132754323fc1915e8d21dcfc0ef68ab084c6fb) is instantiated with `final.callPackage ./gui-assets { }` and needs a top-level `svgo`; the overlay maps `svgo = prev.svgo or final.nodePackages.svgo` (no-op on nixpkgs >= 25.11 which ships pkgs.svgo, throw with instructions if neither exists). mobile-nixos composes its own overlay through the same `nixpkgs.overlays` option (modules/nixpkgs.nix at the pinned rev) and the flake's mobile eval uses stock eval-config.nix, so both land in the SAME pkgs fixed point — root cause verified by READING the pinned sources only, NOT by evaluating. flake.nix was NOT touched.
