correction  : mobile-nixos is ACTIVELY MAINTAINED — rev 2c13275 is dated
              2026-07-12 and its CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml) tracks
              `nixpkgs=channel:nixos-unstable`, NOT a stable release. That is
