              snapshot mobile-nixos targets (24.05 has libinput's luaSupport but
              lacks services.eg25-manager; 24.11 has eg25-manager but dropped the
              libinput args — no stable release satisfies both).
fix         : point the mobile image at nixos-unstable. flake.nix now declares a
              `nixpkgs-mobile` input pinned to an explicit unstable rev
              (18b9261cb3294b6d2a06d03f96872827b8fe2698) and `evalMobile` imports
